{"id":1279,"date":"2021-04-23T13:32:39","date_gmt":"2021-04-23T13:32:39","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/?post_type=rdrcnews&#038;p=1279"},"modified":"2021-04-23T21:00:28","modified_gmt":"2021-04-23T21:00:28","slug":"amplified-queens-streetwise-mba-graduation-ceremony","status":"publish","type":"rdrcnews","link":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/rdrcnews\/amplified-queens-streetwise-mba-graduation-ceremony\/","title":{"rendered":"Amplified Queens StreetWise MBA Graduation Ceremony"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"color: #b87614;\">Tuesday, April 27th, 10am-11:30am &#8211; &#8220;Amplify Queens Streeetwise MBA Graduation Ceremony&#8221;<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">After seven months, in which it became not only a vast resource for local businesses but also a sterling economic surge of growth, &#8220;AQS StreetWise MBA&#8221;, the RDRC powered by Interise business resource program, comes to an end.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">All are invited to join us, Tuesday, April 27th, from 10am-11:30 to celebrate the graduation of 14 businesses that pivoted, grew, and forged relationships that will last a long time. Register via Zoom <span style=\"color: #b87714;\"><a style=\"color: #b87714;\" href=\"https:\/\/zoom.us\/meeting\/register\/tJModOGupz4jHNBg5-gjTqWLZQoh3FTWc6MK\">here<\/a><\/span>.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">The Rockaway Development &amp; Revitalization Corporation&#8217;s Amplify Queens StreetWise MBA Program is RDRC&#8217;s commitment to the advancement and economic growth of Queens-based small businesses and professionals. The launch of the,\u00a0<span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a class=\"editor-rtfLink\" style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/rdrcnews\/rdrc-announcing-amplify-queens-streetwise-mba-program-powered-by-interise\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Amplify Queens Streetwise MBA Program<\/a><\/span>\u00a0powered by\u00a0<a class=\"editor-rtfLink\" style=\"color: #000080;\" href=\"https:\/\/interise.org\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Interise<\/a>, financial support of\u00a0<a class=\"editor-rtfLink\" style=\"color: #000080;\" href=\"https:\/\/www.santanderbank.com\/us\/pages\/personal\/checking-accounts-acq?utm_source=GOOGLE&amp;utm_medium=cpc&amp;utm_campaign=trilia-checking-acquisition-search&amp;utm_term=santander&amp;gclid=Cj0KCQiAw_H-BRD-ARIsALQE_2MVnClY7zSMk4fVIe4aeTIR2x74mQN8KSogazE7pbdvA0Rlv73ObFwaAoGZEALw_wcB&amp;gclsrc=aw.ds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Santander Bank<\/a>, did what it was supposed to: assist Queens-based small business owners with the tools and methodologies to get out of isolation, work their business and get to the next level of growth; during a pandemic, and beyond.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">We extend a huge thanks to <span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/inspire.enterprise\/?hl=en\">Danielle Douglas, President of Inspire Enterprise, &#8220;Live the Vision&#8221;<\/a><\/span>, who was Facilitator for seven months; moreover, she never allowed the program to become uninviting. She was able to keep the conversations flowing with constructive, insightful feedback and created a social capital bonding between business\/instructor\/program manager. Danielle, you did a fantastic job.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">During the time, we shared stories with you. Experience\u00a0 testimonials <span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/rdrcnews\/rdrc-interise-queens-amplified-women-of-the-month\/\">here<\/a><\/span> from local businesses who have received economic developmental growth; while partaking in RDRC&#8217;s training, and business resources offered to the community. Stay connected, and I will keep you updated on programs and business resources as they become available.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">The CBO&#8217;s website is the primary source of news in the Downtown Far Rockaway neighborhood. It provides information on community happenings, business opportunities, invitations, and information on our programs and services. Join our\u00a0<span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a class=\"editor-rtfLink\" style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/visitor.r20.constantcontact.com\/manage\/optin?v=001f-KEXzn5tO1N9oJq961YEq-GzWV1xAIboWtxqYSZXpq5yO1UUgfaSniqtf1xswR-A8b9vOUVS7HXpQIU0guJvspmnPOyroO7_bzKHe449Dw%3D\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">weekly electronic newsletter<\/a><\/span>\u00a0for upcoming happenings and business resources; subscribers will also receive periodic invites to special RDRC events.<\/span><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Tuesday, April 27th, 10am-11:30am &#8211; &#8220;Amplify Queens Streeetwise MBA Graduation Ceremony&#8221; After seven months, in which it became not only a vast resource for local businesses but also a sterling economic surge of growth, &#8220;AQS StreetWise MBA&#8221;, the RDRC powered by Interise business resource program, comes to an end. All are invited to join us, [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":1287,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"class_list":["post-1279","rdrcnews","type-rdrcnews","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/rdrcnews\/1279","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/rdrcnews"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/rdrcnews"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/1287"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=1279"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}